      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, Line 15a</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>We did not pay the CEO salary for his services in this capacity in 2024. Our CEO/ Board President volunteered in this capacity for 2024 to keep expenses down. This is valued at approximately $53,335. The CEO was only paid for clocked-in administrative time or clinican time related to patient care as he was also a Licensed acupuncturist at our Storefront Wellness center. In that capacity, for "Clinician" time, he earned a flat minimum of $20/hr + 40% commission on what patients paid for their services on our sliding scale after the cost of his hourly. For "Administrative" time, he received only the flat $20 hourly. This was separately calculated so that the Administrative time did not affect the expense of his hourly against clinician service commissions. This was considered FAR below market value and is the same compensation formula used for ALL the providers on our clinical team. This salary totaled $13,865 in 2024.</ExplanationTxt>
